	chapter.7A00000000000010.title: "Kjerag: National Dossier"
	quest.7D10000000000001.title: "National Setting"
	quest.7D10000000000001.quest_subtitle: "Summary of PRTS nation records"
	quest.7D10000000000001.quest_desc: ["A perpetually snowy mountain nation in north-central Terra. Secular affairs are governed by the Tri-Clan Council, a religious institution maintains sacred tradition, and the country is undergoing opening and modernization.\n\nSource boundary: PRTS Terra geography records; this entry does not invent undisclosed lore."]
