	quest.C300000000000073.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Caster Operators have +40 ASPD.", "Description: Though the relationship between music and Arts is marvelous indeed, umm, this is not an excuse for some peoples' tone-deafness.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
