	quest.C300000000000074.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000074.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Increases the SP regen rate of Caster Operators by +0.4/s", "Description: 'When a caster intends to go all out, they will display a completely different temperament — even if we're talking about something like Miss Skyfire's grumpiness.'", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
