	quest.C300000000000075.title: "Broken Wand Malediction"
	quest.C300000000000075.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000075.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Caster Operators have -40% HP, but deal +70% Arts damage", "Description: It is virtually impossible to identify when the Sarkaz first encountered Originium, and the origins of these ancient Arts have long been separated from actual reality and common sense.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
