	quest.C300000000000099.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000099.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Increases the SP regen rate of Auto Recovery skills by +0.2/s", "Description: Bolívar's cheap specialty drink dates back hundreds of years. It is mixed with a variety of spices, and is known for not being very good.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
