	quest.C30000000000009D.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000009D.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Increases the SP regen rate of Offensive and Defensive Recovery skills by 1 SP per 3.5s.", "Description: A cheap distilled spirit originally produced in Bolívar. It has a strong taste and is widely praised by Columbia's explorers.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000009D.title: "Obtain Barrens Tequila"
	quest.C30000000000009E.title: "Captain Morgans Wine"
	quest.C30000000000009E.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000009E.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Increases the SP regen rate of Offensive and Defensive Recovery skills by 1 SP per 3s.", "Description: A wine produced in the Iberian region. Despite having gained popularity in the heart of Victoria's bustling cities, it is now discontinued.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000009E.title: "Obtain Captain Morgans Wine"
	quest.C30000000000009F.title: "Water Of Life"
	quest.C30000000000009F.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000009F.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Increases the SP regen rate of Offensive and Defensive Recovery skills by 1 SP per 2.5s.", "Description: The strongest Ursine liquors go straight to one's head, but it's said that the healthy Ursine adult can down several bottles.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000009F.title: "Obtain Water Of Life"
	quest.C3000000000000A0.title: "Royal Liqueur"
	quest.C3000000000000A0.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000A0.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Increases the SP regen rate of Offensive and Defensive Recovery skills by 1 SP per 1.5s.", "Description: The fine wines of the extinct country, Gaul, have now become expensive, prime treasures for collectors. The place of production is now a part of Leithanien, but the technique has been lost.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000A0.title: "Obtain Royal Liqueur"
	quest.C3000000000000A5.title: "Coin Operated Toy"
	quest.C3000000000000A5.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000A5.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For each 5 Originium Ingots in possession, all friendly units have +3 ASPD", "Description: No idea why anyone would like a design like this, but its overall concept is indeed praiseworthy—Just insert a coin, and even a statue will start moving. There is nothing truer in this world.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000A5.title: "Obtain Coin Operated Toy"
	quest.C3000000000000A6.title: "Chivalric Commandments New Edition"
	quest.C3000000000000A6.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000A6.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For each 5 Originium Ingots in possession, all friendly units have +5 ASPD", "Description: Taking solemn vows is a thing of the past. The spirit of modern knighthood requires more flexible displays. Go ahead and input your number in the communications device, and you too will be an honorary knight.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000A6.title: "Obtain Chivalric Commandments New Edition"
	quest.C3000000000000A7.title: "Golden Chalice"
	quest.C3000000000000A7.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000A7.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For each 5 Originium Ingots in possession, all friendly units have +7 ASPD", "Description: Saints, knights, and pietists. All of them are madmen. Dear God, even the chalice itself is made of pure gold!", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000A7.title: "Obtain Golden Chalice"
	quest.C3000000000000A8.title: "Spinach Pack"
	quest.C3000000000000A8.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000A8.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All friendly units have +60% ATK for one second after their skill becomes active", "Description: Many Cautus out there believe that popping the contents of this can into their mouths will grant them immense strength. The marketing's effectiveness is a classic success story in the industry.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000A8.title: "Obtain Spinach Pack"
	quest.C3000000000000A9.title: "No 073 Safety Reagent"
	quest.C3000000000000A9.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000A9.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All friendly units have +65% ATK for one second after their skill becomes active", "Description: A perfectly safe product of a cautiously controlled experiment. Perfectly safe, definitely will not explode, and keeps your mind at ease.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000A9.title: "Obtain No 073 Safety Reagent"
	quest.C3000000000000AA.title: "Wrath Of Siracusans"
	quest.C3000000000000AA.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000AA.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All friendly units have +100% ATK for one second after their skill becomes active", "Description: The signature pasta dish of an 'authentic Siracusan restaurant' that once operated in the capital of Gaul. The dish's unique taste, and particularly its sauce, a blend of thick chocolate sauce and Originium Slug liver, earned the praise of many Gaulish nobles. Supposedly, though, this dish nearly caused a diplomatic crisis between Siracusa and Gaul.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000AA.title: "Obtain Wrath Of Siracusans"
	quest.C3000000000000AC.title: "Ribbon Of Honor"
	quest.C3000000000000AC.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000AC.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All friendly units have +100% ATK when blocking only one enemy", "Description: Numerous actors have played this character, yet none of them were able to save the character's dearest friend.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000AC.title: "Obtain Ribbon Of Honor"
	quest.C3000000000000C1.title: "Right Eye Of The Natator"
	quest.C3000000000000C1.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000C1.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Guard and Sniper Operators have +15% ATK, but Supporter and Caster Operators have -5% ATK", "Description: One half of the Gaulish empress's crown is now housed in the Royal Museum of Londinium. When she learned of the death of the emperor, the empress consort was determined to fight her enemies to the end—for her country, and for her departed beloved.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000C1.title: "Obtain Right Eye Of The Natator"
	quest.C3000000000000C2.title: "Left Eye Of The Natator"
	quest.C3000000000000C2.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000C2.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Supporter and Caster Operators have +15% ATK, but Guard and Sniper Operators have -5% ATK", "Description: One half of the Gaulish empress's crown is now stored housed in the Leithanian Queen Library. The empress dismissed all her attendants, granted clemency to all criminals, and sat solemnly alone on the throne that was once her husband's, awaiting the invaders—She was determined to die not by at hands of her enemies, but under the effects of Originium crystals.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000C2.title: "Obtain Left Eye Of The Natator"
	quest.C3000000000000C6.title: "Familiar Sculpture"
	quest.C3000000000000C6.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000C6.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All enemy units have -15 ASPD.", "Description: A familiar face but a different vibe. Perhaps you have met this person?", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000C6.title: "Obtain Familiar Sculpture"
	quest.C3000000000000CA.title: "Bladedance"
	quest.C3000000000000CA.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000CA.quest_desc: ["Original effect: When the battle begins, a random Operator will have +100% ATK and +100% Max HP within the operation", "Description: An artifact left behind by a 'Crimson Troupe' member. 'Bladedance' was a quiet Sargon dancer as well as a warrior of spectacular martial prowess, and her loyalty to the troupe is unparalleled. Even among the members of the troupe, there are few people who know of her dark past.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000CA.title: "Obtain Bladedance"
	quest.C3000000000000E0.title: "Old Fan"
	quest.C3000000000000E0.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000E0.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All Operators gain ATK +10% for every different type of Operator class in the squad", "Description: When it rains for several days on end, the old Yanese Tianshi complains to his friends about the pain in his knees, before casually waving his fan and driving away the rainclouds. It is about time he taught this trick to his young apprentice, currently working at the Central Judicial Office.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000E0.title: "Obtain Old Fan"
	quest.C3000000000000E5.title: "Focus"
	quest.C3000000000000E5.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000E5.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Whenever you deploy a unit, deal 3000 Arts damage to a random enemy and the area around it", "Description: The stage lights focus on the hero. The actor gives one last dying cry, before the curtains are brought down by Death.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000E5.title: "Obtain Focus"
	quest.C3000000000000E7.title: "Assault Co Op Sharp Blade"
	quest.C3000000000000E7.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000E7.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Increases the ATK of Vanguard and Guard Operators by +8% for each Vanguard or Guard Operator in the combat squad.", "Description: Use the sharpest spear to strike the hardest shield. I guarantee you that the shield will break first, trust me.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000E7.title: "Obtain Assault Co Op Sharp Blade"
	quest.C3000000000000E9.title: "Fortification Contract Phalanx"
	quest.C3000000000000E9.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000E9.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Increases the ATK of Defender and Supporter Operators by +8% for each Defender or Supporter Operator in the combat squad.", "Description: Like a huge ship running over rubble.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000E9.title: "Obtain Fortification Contract Phalanx"
	quest.C3000000000000EB.title: "Long Range Contract Remote Strike"
	quest.C3000000000000EB.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000EB.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Increases the ATK of Medic and Sniper Operators by +8% for each Medic or Sniper Operator in the combat squad.", "Description: If you can solve the problem from a reasonable distance, why do you have to literally butt heads?", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000EB.title: "Obtain Long Range Contract Remote Strike"
	quest.C3000000000000EC.title: "Long Range Contract Assassination"
	quest.C3000000000000EC.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000EC.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Increases the ASPD of Medic and Sniper Operators by +6 for each Medic or Sniper Operator in the combat squad.", "Description: Can't tell friends from foes at this distance? Unload a volley at them then. The foes are the ones that fail to avoid it.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000EC.title: "Obtain Long Range Contract Assassination"
	quest.C3000000000000ED.title: "Sabotage Co Op Elimination"
	quest.C3000000000000ED.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000ED.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Increases the ATK of Caster and Specialist Operators by +8% for each Caster or Specialist Operator in the combat squad.", "Description: External destruction, internal disintegration.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000ED.title: "Obtain Sabotage Co Op Elimination"
	quest.C3000000000000EE.title: "Sabotage Co Op Suppression"
	quest.C3000000000000EE.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000EE.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Increases the ASPD of Caster and Specialist Operators by +6 for each Caster or Specialist Operator in the combat squad.", "Description: Don't worry about accuracy. Take enough shots, and you're guaranteed to land something!", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
