	quest.C3000000000000F7.title: "Chilled Seaweed Salad"
	quest.C3000000000000F7.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000F7.quest_desc: ["Original effect: 【结构化】可携带干员+1，所有我方单位的攻击速度+1\n【半结构化】可携带干员+1，所有我方单位的攻击速度+3\n【非结构化】可携带干员+1，所有我方单位的攻击速度+5\n【混沌化】可携带干员+1，所有我方单位的攻击速度+7", "Description: 曾是令伊比利亚人自傲的民族美食，如今已因海嗣横行，渐渐离开了人们的记忆。", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000F7.title: "Obtain Chilled Seaweed Salad"
	quest.C3000000000000F8.title: "Orange Storm"
	quest.C3000000000000F8.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000F8.quest_desc: ["Original effect: 【结构化】可携带干员+1，所有我方单位的攻击力+1%\n【半结构化】可携带干员+1，所有我方单位的攻击力+3%\n【非结构化】可携带干员+1，所有我方单位的攻击力+5%\n【混沌化】可携带干员+1，所有我方单位的攻击力+7%", "Description: 约翰老妈糖果产品，畅销橙子味，以廉价美味为卖点，在孩子中很有人气。", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000F8.title: "Obtain Orange Storm"
	quest.C3000000000000F9.title: "Coffee Plains Coffee Candy"
	quest.C3000000000000F9.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000F9.quest_desc: ["Original effect: 【结构化】可携带干员+2，所有我方单位的攻击速度+2\n【半结构化】可携带干员+2，所有我方单位的攻击速度+4\n【非结构化】可携带干员+2，所有我方单位的攻击速度+6\n【混沌化】可携带干员+2，所有我方单位的攻击速度+8", "Description: 多索雷斯咖啡品牌糖果产品，现已广销各地。添加真实咖啡因，让你从上班清醒到加班。", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000F9.title: "Obtain Coffee Plains Coffee Candy"
	quest.C3000000000000FA.title: "Screaming Cherry"
	quest.C3000000000000FA.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000000FA.quest_desc: ["Original effect: 【结构化】可携带干员+2，所有我方单位的攻击力+2%\n【半结构化】可携带干员+2，所有我方单位的攻击力+4%\n【非结构化】可携带干员+2，所有我方单位的攻击力+6%\n【混沌化】可携带干员+2，所有我方单位的攻击力+8%", "Description: 约翰老妈糖果产品，小众醋腌樱桃味，销量无法比肩畅销款，但一直有一小群忠实而稳定的消费者。听说某位约翰老妈董事就钟爱此口味。", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000FA.title: "Obtain Screaming Cherry"
	quest.C300000000000100.title: "Sea Terror Jerky"
	quest.C300000000000100.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000100.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All enemy units have -21% DEF", "Description: Once their desire to survive overwhelms their terror, the famished Iberians will devour this 'food,' subsequently turning into Sea Terrors on some ordinary day.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000100.title: "Obtain Sea Terror Jerky"
	quest.C300000000000101.title: "Vortex Confluence"
	quest.C300000000000101.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000101.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Specialist Operators have +30% ATK, and Caster Operators have +3% ATK", "Description: Rule the waves, rule the currents. Once, Ægir and the ocean were synonymous.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000101.title: "Obtain Vortex Confluence"
	quest.C300000000000102.title: "Ocean Voyage"
	quest.C300000000000102.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000102.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Caster Operators have +30% ATK, and Specialist Operators have +3% ATK", "Description: Twice they escaped to land, but in this they nevertheless still take pride: Ægir once measured the ocean.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000102.title: "Obtain Ocean Voyage"
	quest.C300000000000104.title: "Chitinous Ripper"
	quest.C300000000000104.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000104.quest_desc: ["Original effect: When a battle begins, a random Operator will have +100% ATK and +100% HP for that battle", "Description: A more efficient way of growing an exoskeleton. It can tear prey apart, resist impact, and also be turned into a delicacy for its kin.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000104.title: "Obtain Chitinous Ripper"
	quest.C300000000000107.title: "Abandoned Banner"
	quest.C300000000000107.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000107.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Designates one deployable tile at the beginning of battle; friendly units deployed on that tile have +50% ATK and +50 ASPD", "Description: There is nothing special about this dismasted flag, but the Abyssal Hunters can use it to find combat supplies that the Ægir once secretly stashed in various spots across the ocean. They have no way of knowing what the ocean has forgiven, but there is no need for them to forgive. The fight never ends.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000107.title: "Obtain Abandoned Banner"
	quest.C30000000000010C.title: "Convalescence Experience Card"
	quest.C30000000000010C.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000010C.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All Operators gain +40 ASPD for 10 seconds after deployment", "Description: A special service from the Convalescent Garden! Each Operator is entitled to one physiotherapy session from the Convalescent Garden before each of their field operations. Non-transferrable.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000010C.title: "Obtain Convalescence Experience Card"
	quest.C30000000000010D.title: "Convalescence Prime Membership"
	quest.C30000000000010D.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000010D.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All Operators gain +70 ASPD for 10 seconds after deployment", "Description: A special service collaboratively provided by the Convalescent Garden and the Medical Department! Each Operator is entitled to one comprehensive physical and psychological assessment, as well as a physiotherapy session. Afterwards, they can also taste Podenco's homemade flower cakes.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000010D.title: "Obtain Convalescence Prime Membership"
	quest.C30000000000010F.title: "Emergency Active Agent"
	quest.C30000000000010F.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000010F.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Operators have increased ASPD proportional to how low their HP is, up to a maximum of +60 ASPD at 30% HP", "Description: An injection commonly used in Rim Billiton's local mines. Its strong active ingredient can stimulate the workers' senses and ensure their work efficiency in extreme environments. Life and engineering both have deadlines, and for them, this is simply a multiple-choice question.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000010F.title: "Obtain Emergency Active Agent"
	quest.C300000000000118.title: "Stalwart Aid Assistance"
	quest.C300000000000118.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000118.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Friendly units within the attack range of Supporter Operators gain +20% ATK", "Description: Bringing meals, showing the right route to take, or even having a heart-to-heart. The key difference between victory and defeat often lies in these little things.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000118.title: "Obtain Stalwart Aid Assistance"
	quest.C30000000000011A.title: "Rusted Blade Execution Grinding"
	quest.C30000000000011A.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000011A.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Specialist Operators have +30 ASPD", "Description: An endless amount of rust to scrape off, and endless amount of work.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000011A.title: "Obtain Rusted Blade Execution Grinding"
