	quest.C30000000000011F.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000011F.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Increases the SP recovery rate of Core Caster, Mystic Caster, and Summoner Operators by +0.5/s whenever they use a skill, up to 4 stacks", "Description: The ocean's flow never ceases, because it is always surging.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
