	quest.C30000000000014E.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All friendly units have +10 ASPD, all enemy units have -10 ASPD", "Description: An exquisite water flow meter, capable of monitoring the flow of ocean currents in real time. A common sight among the Ægir people's underwater transportation tools.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
