	quest.C300000000000161.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every collectible owned, [Caster] ATK +2%, ASPD +1", "Description: When you have taken in the wisdom of all the land, ignorance becomes the enemy's weakness.\n", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
