	quest.C300000000000162.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every collectible owned, [Caster] ATK +3%, ASPD +2", "Description: Knowledge and experience should not remain untapped. They should be the key to victory.\n", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
