	quest.C30000000000016F.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All Operators gain ATK +25% and ASPD +25, but lose 25 HP every second", "Description: The moment she turns around to head north, mountains in black lie before her eyes, just like the omen she saw many years ago.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
