	quest.C300000000000181.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000181.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Protector, Arts Protector, and Duelist Operators inflict Bind on all nearby enemies lasting 1 second every 2 seconds, and deal True damage equal to 100% of their ATK", "Description: What she means by standing over there, is that you cannot cross.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
