	quest.C30000000000018C.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Designates one deployable tile at the beginning of battle; allied Operators deployed on that tile or its surrounding 8 tiles will grant 1 SP to another Operator within those tiles whenever they gain SP from Offensive or Defensive Recovery", "Description: Those within this ring receive the attention of the snow and earth.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
