	quest.C3000000000001AB.title: "Bend Spears Battlecry"
	quest.C3000000000001AB.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000001AB.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every Guard Operator on the field, all allies gain ATK +8% (stacks up to 8 times)", "Description: Combat is also a group activity. The more people there are, the more confident they get, and the more powerful they become with weapons in hand.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
