	quest.C3000000000001AD.title: "Fatal Bolts Succession"
	quest.C3000000000001AD.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000001AD.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every Sniper Operator on the field, all allies gain ASPD +12 (stacks up to 8 times)", "Description: Hear the sound of the first arrow, as the last pierces the torso.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000001AD.title: "Obtain Fatal Bolts Succession"
	quest.C3000000000001AF.title: "Stalwart Aid Linkup"
	quest.C3000000000001AF.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000001AF.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every Supporter Operator on the field, increases the SP regen rate of Auto Recovery skills by +0.2/s (stacks up to 8 times)", "Description: Hand in hand, shoulder to shoulder, brace yourselves, and look straight ahead.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000001AF.title: "Obtain Stalwart Aid Linkup"
	quest.C3000000000001B4.title: "Friston P"
	quest.C3000000000001B4.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000001B4.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All Allies permanently gain ASPD +5 for every Emergency Ops cleared (stacks up to 15 times)", "Description: Friston would certainly not miss out on an opportunity to explore the secrets of another predecessor civilization. Oh, but Closure didn't even consider making backups, so DON'T tell her about this!", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000001B4.title: "Obtain Friston P"
	quest.C3000000000001B5.title: "Vinecreep Mortar Gunner"
	quest.C3000000000001B5.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000001B5.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Enemies defeated while airborne will deal 3000 physical damage to surrounding enemies", "Description: It's no surprise such a fantastical weapon would appear when people from different cultures let down their guard and communicate with sincerity.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000001B5.title: "Obtain Vinecreep Mortar Gunner"
	quest.C3000000000001B8.title: "Paradigm Apparatus"
	quest.C3000000000001B8.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000001B8.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All enemies have ASPD -30 when on tiles affected by Dominion", "Description: Naturally, Ursus was unwilling to divulge their research into the Royal Guard to other countries. But ultimately, they caved to international pressure and shared some of their technology—after all, this was all to find the source of the demons.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
