	quest.C3000000000001C8.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every Guard Operator on the field, all allied units gain ATK +8% (Stacks up to 8 times)", "Description: Those with power can always help each other to success.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
