	quest.C3000000000001CE.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000001CE.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Splash Caster, Chain Caster, and Mech-accord Caster Operators recover 2 SP each time they deal damage to an enemy unit; If you have Broken Wand - Undulation, they also gain +20 ASPD", "Description: Blasts conquer, the wake deafening.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
