	quest.C3000000000001CF.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000001CF.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Ambusher, Merchant, and Geek Operators gain +25% ATK for every 30 seconds they remain on the battlefield (Stacks up to 5 times); If you have Rusted Blade - Protraction, maximum stack increases to 8", "Description: Protracted battles, a home of carnage.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
