	quest.C3000000000001D0.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000001D0.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Core Caster, Primal Caster, and Ritualist Operators gain +0.5/s SP recovery rate whenever they use a skill (Stacks up to 4 times)", "Description: Mists part, the truth approaches.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
