	quest.C3000000000001D7.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000001D7.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All Operators have +35 ASPD if you used an Inspirer as the battle started", "Description: 'We use the name 'Teekaz witchcraft' to honor what our ancestors discovered during the uncivilized parts of our history. But today it has become a discipline permeating all of Terra, and our explorations and developments in this field are far from over.'", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
