	quest.C3000000000001DE.title: "Soul Binding Bone"
	quest.C3000000000001DE.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000001DE.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every Thought you have, all Operators gain +3% ATK", "Description: The elder revenant made a cage with his own bones to seal his kin within, and then tracked down his revenant kin scattered across the land in this tattered husk.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000001DE.title: "Obtain Soul Binding Bone"
	quest.C3000000000001DF.title: "Soul Furnace S Fuel"
	quest.C3000000000001DF.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000001DF.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every Thought you have, all Operators gain +5% ATK", "Description: The bones were thrown into the furnace, sending flames bursting forth. The revenants entangle into each other, transforming all their lament, fury, serenity, and shame into the energy that keeps Kazdel moving.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000001DF.title: "Obtain Soul Furnace S Fuel"
	quest.C3000000000001E9.title: "Talons Of Hatred"
	quest.C3000000000001E9.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000001E9.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All allied units and enemies have +20% ATK; Emergency Ops will appear more often when refreshing nodes; triggers wondrous effects in Encounter nodes", "Description: 'A vampire killed my sister, a Nachzehrer took my papa, and mama escaped with me. I'll never compromise with the Sarkaz. They can repent when they're all gone.'", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000001E9.title: "Obtain Talons Of Hatred"
	quest.C3000000000001F2.title: "Sigil Mystery"
	quest.C3000000000001F2.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C3000000000001F2.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All Operators gain +30 Starting SP, but natural SP recovery rate is reduced by 50%; only active in Bizarre Fragments", "Description: 'With the sovereign's approval, the Northwind Witch Qalaiša taught the Nachzehrers how to draw energy from the Eternal Hunt's rigid laws. To Nezzsalem, that was the start of his subjects surpassing nature with reason. His decision exceeded everyone's expectations, and the Nachzehrers continue to revere him as their liege after becoming Nachzehrer Beschützers.'", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000001F2.title: "Obtain Sigil Mystery"
	quest.C300000000000200.title: "Devilbane Banner"
	quest.C300000000000200.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000200.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Operators recover 2 SP when dealing damage to [Sarkaz] enemies", "Description: Made by Sarkaz mercenaries loyal to Iberia, and used to kill Sarkaz mercenaries loyal to Leithanien. Many years later, Sarkaz mercenaries loyal to Victoria picked it up and gave it its name.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000200.title: "Obtain Devilbane Banner"
	quest.C300000000000208.title: "Balor Saca S Arrogance"
	quest.C300000000000208.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000208.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Elite and Leader enemies gain +20% HP, DEF, and ATK", "Description: Lava obediently followed Balor'sača's army and spread across the land. They cared not for the Elder Hegemons, nor for their fellow Sarkaz. This land belongs to the Diαblo, and there is no need for others. As their King, Balor'sača absolutely cannot allow the crown to fall on the head of another.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000208.title: "Obtain Balor Saca S Arrogance"
	quest.C300000000000209.title: "Ylis S Ravings"
	quest.C300000000000209.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000209.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All Operators start with -20 SP", "Description: Alas, the poor man. He could not comprehend the crown's power, and became a puppet. He was no longer his humble self, and lost the will to speak his own words. He became the first sacrifice to the crown's awakening.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000209.title: "Obtain Ylis S Ravings"
	quest.C30000000000020B.title: "Judgement Guard"
	quest.C30000000000020B.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000020B.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every Bizarre Fragment Collectible owned, Guard Operators gain +20% ATK and +20 ASPD", "Description: Faced with the revenants' myriad mysteries, the Guards brandish their weapons and cut a path.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000020B.title: "Obtain Judgement Guard"
	quest.C30000000000020E.title: "Judgement Sniper"
	quest.C30000000000020E.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000020E.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every Bizarre Fragment Collectible owned, Sniper Operators gain +20% ATK and +20 ASPD", "Description: Faced with the revenants' myriad mysteries, the Snipers adjust positions and unleash their firepower.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000020E.title: "Obtain Judgement Sniper"
	quest.C300000000000210.title: "Judgement Medic"
	quest.C300000000000210.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000210.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every Bizarre Fragment Collectible owned, Medic Operators gain +50% ATK", "Description: Faced with the revenants' myriad mysteries, the Medics treat the wounded and wait for the tides to shift.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000210.title: "Obtain Judgement Medic"
	quest.C300000000000211.title: "Judgement Caster"
	quest.C300000000000211.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000211.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every Bizarre Fragment Collectible owned, Caster Operators gain +20% ATK and +20 ASPD", "Description: Faced with the revenants' myriad mysteries, the Casters release their Arts to deconstruct them.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000211.title: "Obtain Judgement Caster"
	quest.C300000000000212.title: "Judgement Supporter"
	quest.C300000000000212.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000212.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every Bizarre Fragment Collectible owned, Supporter Operators gain +50% ATK", "Description: Faced with the revenants' myriad mysteries, the Supporters break the mold and offer their unique ingenuity.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000212.title: "Obtain Judgement Supporter"
	quest.C300000000000213.title: "Hand Of Fireworks"
	quest.C300000000000213.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000213.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Marksman, Loopshooter, and Sentry Protector Operators have a 25% chance on each attack to shoot an extra projectile, dealing 200% ATK as AoE Physical Damage", "Description: Bang! Boom! A pleasant surprise.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000213.title: "Obtain Hand Of Fireworks"
	quest.C300000000000214.title: "Clotheskaz"
	quest.C300000000000214.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000214.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Operators immediately obtain 30 SP after their skill ends for the first time", "Description: The Clotheskaz community thrives on the fierce competition among the creatures that wear them.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000214.title: "Obtain Clotheskaz"
	quest.C30000000000021D.title: "Wondrous Graffiti"
	quest.C30000000000021D.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000021D.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Whenever an enemy enters the Objective Point, all Operators on field gain 20 SP", "Description: The Liches often add a few more strokes to these pieces of 'street art'. According to them, it is mostly an economical way to bolster the city streets' defenses.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000021D.title: "Obtain Wondrous Graffiti"
	quest.C30000000000021F.title: "Enlistment Order"
	quest.C30000000000021F.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000021F.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Operators deployed on the 8 tiles surrounding an Incursion Point gain +100% ATK", "Description: An enlistment order from the museum collection, issued during the great hunt. It calls for members capable of infiltrating a Feranmut's lair, and attached is a list of names who have signed their lives away.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000021F.title: "Obtain Enlistment Order"
	quest.C300000000000220.title: "Geist Binding Rope"
	quest.C300000000000220.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000220.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Summons have -5 DP Cost, -25% Redeployment Time, and gain +30% ATK", "Description: Geists do the Sui Regulators' bidding while constrained by these ropes. Be it pouring tea or watering plants, they excel at simple, repetitive work.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000220.title: "Obtain Geist Binding Rope"
	quest.C300000000000223.title: "Borderbound Mirror"
	quest.C300000000000223.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000223.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Enemies' damage dealt on their first attack -90%", "Description: Mirrors like these often hung over windows and entrances of the Garden of Grotesqueries. When visitors run into unexpected danger, the realm within a mirror turns into an emergency shelter—until it shatters.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000223.title: "Obtain Borderbound Mirror"
	quest.C300000000000226.title: "Toy Slingshot"
	quest.C300000000000226.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000226.quest_desc: ["Original effect: When an Operator uses a skill, deals 30% of ATK as Arts damage to all enemies within Attack Range", "Description: A bronze slingshot born from the forge. When the rubber band is pulled, small copper companions huddle up into a surprising weighty ball, waiting to be launched. 'Here, have fun. It's not dangerous at all, no, it's just a toy.'", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000226.title: "Obtain Toy Slingshot"
	quest.C300000000000227.title: "Snack Basket"
	quest.C300000000000227.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000227.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All Operators gain +100% natural SP recovery, effect lasts until any Operator manually activates a skill", "Description: A backpack-basket filled with snacks to be sold outside the garden was confiscated at the entrance. The staff awkwardly ask where the items came from, and after you answer honestly, they assure you all is well as they dash in the direction you pointed out with suspicious-looking tools in hand.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000227.title: "Obtain Snack Basket"
	quest.C30000000000022A.title: "Woodblock Prints"
	quest.C30000000000022A.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000022A.quest_desc: ["Original effect: After Operators use an ammo-type skill, gain +2% ATK every time they deal damage (Stacks to 30 times)", "Description: Popular poems engraved on jujube wood. When aloof scholars spot poems they deem inferior circulating amongst the masses, they often scoff and sneer: 'Hmph. What a tragedy, a crime, to waste fine wood like that.'", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000022A.title: "Obtain Woodblock Prints"
	quest.C30000000000022B.title: "Three Feet To All"
	quest.C30000000000022B.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000022B.quest_desc: ["Original effect: After Operators use an ammo-type skill, +100 ASPD for 15 second", "Description: An ancient Yanese movable type printing press. A noble uses words as weapons, while villains... there was once a time when the printing house discovered the word block for 'not' was stolen right before they went to print a work, and the rebuttal text's meaning changed entirely, leaving one unsure whether to cry or not.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000022B.title: "Obtain Three Feet To All"
	quest.C300000000000232.title: "Mother Cauldron"
	quest.C300000000000232.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000232.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Operators on Vagary Tiles gain +10% ATK (Can be upgraded in Leisure, to a max of 10 levels)", "Description: The nine provinces used nine cauldrons to represent them. As for how these cauldrons were even forged in the first place... 'The Mother Cauldron gave birth to them, duh!' Said a certain film master with a smile.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000232.title: "Obtain Mother Cauldron"
	quest.C300000000000235.title: "Brocade Banner"
	quest.C300000000000235.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000235.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Each time an Operator on a Vagary Tile uses a skill, all other Operators on Vagary Tiles recover 1 SP", "Description: Legends say the banner was used by the True Lung who ended the Hundred Clan Rebellion. As it waved in the air, hundreds of generals followed its call... But what holds power is not the banner itself. Rather, it's the collective determination of the people to stop war and make peace.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000235.title: "Obtain Brocade Banner"
	quest.C300000000000237.title: "Elder Mask"
	quest.C300000000000237.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000237.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All enemies blocked by an Operator take 150% of the Operator's ATK as Arts damage every second, and lose 15% hit rate", "Description: The mask of an ancient Yanese hero. This is where the term 'Tianshi' comes from, as his profound wisdom spread to the House of Yan, achieving a millennium of peace before vanishing into thin air.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000237.title: "Obtain Elder Mask"
	quest.C30000000000023A.title: "Fist Classics 123"
	quest.C30000000000023A.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000023A.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Operators gain +5% ATK whenever they use a skill (Stacks up to 40 times)", "Description: Shuo's first collection of his thoughts on Kung Fu. It discusses three aspects: first, fist techniques; second, meaning; and third, the pugilist realm itself. It is said the language used is so cryptic that his students could not understand it, so he asked his younger sister for revisions.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000023A.title: "Obtain Fist Classics 123"
	quest.C30000000000023D.title: "Training Lightning Rod"
	quest.C30000000000023D.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000023D.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Operators gain +0.4/s SP recovery rate whenever they use a skill (Stacks up to 5 times)", "Description: Located on the Tianshi Bureau's mountain peak where Tianshis train their Lei Fa. Apprentices always start with the lightning rod until they're familiar with manipulating thunder. Within the Bureau, it also goes by 'Senior'.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000023D.title: "Obtain Training Lightning Rod"
	quest.C30000000000023E.title: "Fire Poking Stick"
	quest.C30000000000023E.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000023E.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Operators' attacks on Apparition enemies deal additional Arts damage equal to 50% ATK", "Description: The Old Tianshi uses this wooden stick to clean up wicked spirits and overpower Feranmuts, but it spends most days quietly leaning on a kitchen corner wall, only getting picked up to stoke the flames.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000023E.title: "Obtain Fire Poking Stick"
	quest.C300000000000244.title: "Quickbeast Transport"
	quest.C300000000000244.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000244.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every Candleguest in your squad, all Candleguests gain +5 ASPD (Stacks up to 10 times)", "Description: Burdenbeast-drawn vehicles were popular when Yan's Chidao first opened. As the Chidao grew, faster and sturdier vehicles emerged, causing the once-common sight of galloping burdenbeasts to gradually disappear. The thrilling chance of being thrown to the ground at any moment was also slowly forgotten by the masses.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000244.title: "Obtain Quickbeast Transport"
	quest.C300000000000247.title: "Duo Carrier Sedan"
	quest.C300000000000247.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000247.quest_desc: ["Original effect: +15 cost limit; All Vanguard Operators gain +25% ATK and refund DP when deployed", "Description: A chair and two rods separate people into two classes. Today, most sedan chairs are homed in museums, but how many people hold a desire within to be raised by others, overlooking from above?", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000247.title: "Obtain Duo Carrier Sedan"
	quest.C30000000000024D.title: "Metal Expedition Drum"
	quest.C30000000000024D.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000024D.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Operators gain +15% ATK with every coin toss (Stacks up to 10 times); if only Risk Coins tossed, adds an extra stack", "Description: A 'veteran' of the army. Once a messenger on the battlefield, it weathered hardships as it witnessed victory and defeat. Today more advanced communication methods have replaced it, but soldiers can still hear the morale-boosting drum beats before they head into battle.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000024D.title: "Obtain Metal Expedition Drum"
	quest.C300000000000256.title: "Seen Risk"
	quest.C300000000000256.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000256.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Allied Operators deal 50% more Physical and Arts damage to Apparition enemies", "Description: When both signs come together, what old tale do they tell?", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000256.title: "Obtain Seen Risk"
	quest.C300000000000259.title: "Sui S Risk"
	quest.C300000000000259.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000259.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Candleguests gain 100% ATK for 10s after deployment, duration increased by 5s for every Candleguest promoted via combat (Can be increased up to 15 times)", "Description: When both signs come together, what old tale do they tell?", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000259.title: "Obtain Sui S Risk"
	quest.C30000000000025D.title: "Unflinching Masterplan"
	quest.C30000000000025D.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000025D.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Operators lose 50% SP on deployment; When carrying this Collectible, a special Operation option will appear in Pathfinder", "Description: A square piece of wood, boasting a weiqi board on the top and a movable type plate on the back, perfectly supporting one another. The type cannot be used, for a block with 'Ji' and 'Ye' carved can be seen protruding, making it impossible for the frame to be pressed down.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000025D.title: "Obtain Unflinching Masterplan"
	quest.C300000000000266.title: "Little Baizao"
	quest.C300000000000266.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000266.quest_desc: ["Original effect: When an Operator is deployed, all enemies take True damage equivalent to a certain percentage of DP used; if 30 or more DP used, also inflicts Stun for 5s", "Description: A crystallization of war, Originium, and suffering.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000266.title: "Obtain Little Baizao"
	quest.C300000000000267.title: "Cangtong"
	quest.C300000000000267.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000267.quest_desc: ["Original effect: When DP reaches 99 or higher, all enemies take 3000 Arts damage and are Stunned for 2s every 10s", "Description: Lin Qingyan's sword makes no sound when unsheathed, its branch-like appearance concealing its true form. Drape thunder over, and it will surely cleave through wind and blaze, reaching its target in an flash.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000267.title: "Obtain Cangtong"
	quest.C30000000000026C.title: "Craftsman Shadow"
	quest.C30000000000026C.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000026C.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Every time the leftmost Operator from the Deployment Waiting Zone is deployed, all deployed Operators gain 100% of the DP spent as SP", "Description: This shadow puppet was created to honor a skilled artisan who dedicated their life to pursuing perfection. Villains coveted their skills, but not even money or physical suffering made them waver, only hoping their skills would remain unscathed. They later died in a bandit's den, and their works set alight, never to be passed down to further generations.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000026C.title: "Obtain Craftsman Shadow"
	quest.C30000000000026D.title: "Artist Shadow"
	quest.C30000000000026D.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000026D.quest_desc: ["Original effect: The leftmost Operator in the Deployment Waiting Zone gains +10 Starting SP, +30 ASPD, and +30% ATK", "Description: This shadow puppet was created to honor a legendary dancer. Legends tell of summoning mighty waves out of a river, and the beauty of spring drawn from forests with their dances. They dedicated their life to dance, but with age became injured and retired, leaving the mortal realm soon after. Countless dancers have copied their movements, but none have quite made it. What a shame.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000026D.title: "Obtain Artist Shadow"
	quest.C300000000000272.title: "Bells Of Agreement"
	quest.C300000000000272.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000272.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every Candleguest promoted via combat, all Candleguests +40% ATK; after deployment, -4% Redeployment Time and gain 4 DP (Stacks up to 4 times)", "Description: After the inauguration ceremony, the new Candleholder went to meet his seniors—bells woven together with rope, with different techniques and colors—and after listening to the crisp bell chimes, the Candleholder ties a new link.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000272.title: "Obtain Bells Of Agreement"
	quest.C30000000000027B.title: "Broken Wand Absorb"
	quest.C30000000000027B.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000027B.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Caster Operators recover 2 SP every time they deal damage to an enemy unit", "Description: Consume the defeated as nourishment, and embark on an eternal path to victory.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000027B.title: "Obtain Broken Wand Absorb"
	quest.C30000000000027E.title: "Sawblade Bangle"
	quest.C30000000000027E.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000027E.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Operators have ATK +50% when blocking", "Description: Surprise is the key to victory in close quarters.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000027E.title: "Obtain Sawblade Bangle"
	quest.C300000000000280.title: "Crowing Rooftop Figure"
	quest.C300000000000280.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000280.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Allied Operators gradually gain ASPD when not using a skill, up to a maximum of +40 after 40s; bonus is reset when skill ends", "Description: The rooftop figure's call announces the time at the Garden of Grotesqueries. The staff put a great deal of effort into it so it can take flight quickly and let out a cry that reaches every corner of the garden.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000280.title: "Obtain Crowing Rooftop Figure"
	quest.C300000000000284.title: "Fragment Of Ju S Order"
	quest.C300000000000284.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000284.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Operator ATK +50%, bonus lost when skill is activated manually", "Description: A piece of Ju's strange body, now part of the Baizao Museum collection. It was withdrawn from display and put into storage after a group of tourists marched out of the exhibition hall in perfect unison after viewing it.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000284.title: "Obtain Fragment Of Ju S Order"
	quest.C300000000000285.title: "Fragment Of Hou S Soil"
	quest.C300000000000285.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000285.quest_desc: ["Original effect: When an Operator on a Vagary Tile uses a skill, all Operators +40% ATK for 30s", "Description: A piece of Hou's heavy body, once part of the Baizao Museum collection. It disappeared when the exhibition hall turned into a garden; perhaps the Feranmut has already become one with this newborn corner of nature.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000285.title: "Obtain Fragment Of Hou S Soil"
	quest.C30000000000028B.title: "Soldier S Edge"
	quest.C30000000000028B.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C30000000000028B.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Allied Operators +10% ATK for each Balance Coin in Coffer (max +150%)", "Description: Every member of the Imperial Guard is the product of both skill and luck. The same is true of their weapons.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000028B.title: "Obtain Soldier S Edge"
	quest.C300000000000292.title: "Red Sun Crown"
	quest.C300000000000292.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000292.quest_desc: ["Original effect: 高台干员对每个敌人首次造成的伤害提升至300%", "Description: 祂将自己所喜爱的冠冕赠与祂的黎博利孩子。黎博利接受了冠冕，也接受了白昼。于是黎博利翱翔于山巅之上，从此大地没有了黑夜。", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000292.title: "Obtain Red Sun Crown"
