	quest.C300000000000295.quest_desc: ["Original effect: 我方干员击倒敌人时，攻击速度+100，持续2秒", "Description: 鲜血只会让它们更加亢奋。它们在哪里？无处不在。", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
