	quest.C300000000000296.quest_subtitle: "Offense"
	quest.C300000000000296.quest_desc: ["Original effect: 我方干员击倒敌人时，获得2点技力", "Description: 一截断角，散发着令人兴奋的味道，似乎是树海中两头雄性生物打架时掉下的，争斗永远使人成瘾。", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
