	quest.C3000000000002AC.quest_desc: ["Original effect: 我方干员技能结束时获得2点技力", "Description: 一望无际的金色麦田、微风、人们的欢声笑语，你的下一瓶精酿何必等待太久？", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
