	quest.C3000000000002BA.quest_desc: ["Original effect: 炮手、散射手、裂空炮手开启技能时攻击力+150%，持续5秒；拥有残弩-神准时，每3秒获得3点技力", "Description: 我自向天，藐视晴苍。", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
