	quest.C300000000000258.title: "Sui S Flower"
	quest.C300000000000258.quest_subtitle: "Defense"
	quest.C300000000000258.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All Operators have +3 DP Cost, but Candleguest Operators gain +10% HP, ATK, and DEF for every Candleguest in the Squad", "Description: When both signs come together, what old tale do they tell?", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
