	quest.C30000000000025C.title: "Cloud And Paint"
	quest.C30000000000025C.quest_subtitle: "Defense"
	quest.C30000000000025C.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Operators lose 2% of Max HP for 60 seconds on deployment; Leads expedition in a different direction", "Description: There are right and wrong moralities just as weiqi stones has black and white, but the Feranmut hardly cares. Change the realm with a cunning plan typed on paper, but you still require the Sui's will to enter the Tomb of Sui.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000025C.title: "Obtain Cloud And Paint"
	quest.C300000000000262.title: "Merciless"
	quest.C300000000000262.quest_subtitle: "Defense"
	quest.C300000000000262.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All enemies HP and DEF +50%; 'Olden Pride' and some 'Body' segments gain ability to continuously summon enemies", "Description: Strange object created when depicting the bestial Sui. Sui will not allow others to trample upon Its vessel, even if It has yet to awaken. Its body instinctively searches for premonitions of change.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000262.title: "Obtain Merciless"
	quest.C300000000000270.title: "Three Legged Goldfowl"
	quest.C300000000000270.quest_subtitle: "Defense"
	quest.C300000000000270.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Upon acquisition, doubles one of the following resources randomly: Ingots, Hope, or Objective Shield", "Description: The legs of this strange auspicious figure apparently refers to the two-sided coins of prosperity and decline, life and death, and flourish and decay; whichever leg touches a person first grants eternal blessing in that aspect. According to Sui Regulator research, while this creature appears to resemble a fowlbeast, it's unfortunately...", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000270.title: "Obtain Three Legged Goldfowl"
	quest.C30000000000027D.title: "Blaze S Chainsaw"
	quest.C30000000000027D.quest_subtitle: "Defense"
	quest.C30000000000027D.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Enemies take increased damage from allied units as distance is reduced (max 100%)", "Description: She drags herself into hell with her enemies, appraising each other's determination with heat. She has never failed.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000027D.title: "Obtain Blaze S Chainsaw"
	quest.C300000000000282.title: "Yarn Of Real And Unreal"
	quest.C300000000000282.quest_subtitle: "Defense"
	quest.C300000000000282.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Operator DEF +600 and RES +15 when there are other Operators in the 8 surrounding tiles", "Description: Yarn that Yi collected, which Ji is loath to use. After the real and unreal threads were tidied up, it was tossed into a corner of the Garden of Grotesqueries for the beasts to toy with.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000282.title: "Obtain Yarn Of Real And Unreal"
	quest.C300000000000287.title: "Panacea"
	quest.C300000000000287.quest_subtitle: "Defense"
	quest.C300000000000287.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Operator +1200 DEF and +30 RES when affected by negative status (Cold, Frozen, Stun)", "Description: The doctor developed this recipe to soothe the patient's pain and anxiety, giving them more time to tackle the root of the ailment. However, patients often believe it to be a miracle cure because it makes their pain vanish.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000287.title: "Obtain Panacea"
	quest.C300000000000299.title: "Planter S Insurance Policy"
	quest.C300000000000299.quest_subtitle: "Defense"
	quest.C300000000000299.quest_desc: ["Original effect: 若我方干员在5秒内未受到伤害，则获得最大生命20%的屏障", "Description: 一份印得密密麻麻的保单，但条款只在被保人没出意外时有效——好在他们也看不懂上面的内容。", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
