	quest.C3000000000002BE.quest_subtitle: "Defense"
	quest.C3000000000002BE.quest_desc: ["Original effect: 立即进阶一个【术师】干员（不消耗希望），并使其：攻击时降低目标5点法术抗性（最多降低25）", "Description: “我在垃圾桶里看到一本莱塔尼亚教材，是哪位干员不小心丢失的吗？”", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
