	quest.C30000000000008F.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C30000000000008F.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Hope +4, Squad Size Limit +1", "Description: 'In this paradise of mine, the bird will sing forever and ever.'", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000008F.title: "Obtain Glass Bird"
	quest.C300000000000090.title: "Solo Music Box"
	quest.C300000000000090.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000090.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Hope +4, Deployment Limit +1", "Description: An old music box. The music does not play when the box is opened, nor does the figure inside show any signs it is about to move. There is not a peep, and no one is breaking out in dance. Before she begins her performances with Phantom, the lead actress stares blankly into the music box.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000090.title: "Obtain Solo Music Box"
	quest.C300000000000091.title: "Originium Iris"
	quest.C300000000000091.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000091.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Hope +6, Squad Size Limit +2", "Description: A most extravagant bouquet of flowers. The troupe leader has handed flowers like these to the leads during countless curtain calls.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000091.title: "Obtain Originium Iris"
	quest.C300000000000092.title: "Pure Gold Expedition"
	quest.C300000000000092.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000092.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Hope +4, Squad Size Limit +1, Deployment Limit +1", "Description: The regent departed from the wastelands, and markets rose from beneath her dress like sprouts budding in the spring. The road of prosperity connected high mountains and dense forests, following her until she disappeared beyond the cliffs overlooking the western waves. —Ancient Sargon Fairy Tale", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000092.title: "Obtain Pure Gold Expedition"
	quest.C3000000000000B0.title: "Condensed Suppressant"
	quest.C3000000000000B0.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C3000000000000B0.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All friendly units increase their ATK to 150% and silence the enemy for 3 seconds when attacking [Infected Creatures]", "Description: A medical reagent developed by Rhodes Island to suppress acute Oripathy infections. However, further enrichment of the reagent's concentration will cause irreversible damage to the infection site.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000B0.title: "Obtain Condensed Suppressant"
	quest.C3000000000000B7.title: "Gaul Mantle"
	quest.C3000000000000B7.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C3000000000000B7.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All enemy units have +25% ATK, DEF, and Max HP; 4-star and above Operators cost +1 Hope when recruited", "Description: An artifact left behind by the late Gaulish emperor. A symbol of power and glory.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
