	quest.C3000000000000BF.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All enemy units have +10% ATK, DEF, and Max HP; All allied units have -10% ATK when DP is below 99", "Description: 'The Caprinae's spire collapses—'", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
