	quest.C3000000000000C4.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All Operators have +5 DP Cost, but gain +10% ATK, DEF, and Max HP", "Description: A sword lodged in a stone. Was someone bored enough to do this?", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
