	quest.C3000000000000E4.title: "Silence"
	quest.C3000000000000E4.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C3000000000000E4.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Allied Operators gradually gain ATK when not using a skill, up to a maximum of +60% after 60 seconds; resets when a skill expires", "Description: When the climax arrives, the actor grabs his stinging throat and holds back the roiling fire in his chest, all without a word.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000E4.title: "Obtain Silence"
	quest.C3000000000000F0.title: "Guard Cap"
	quest.C3000000000000F0.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C3000000000000F0.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For a single battle, all friendly units have +25% HP each time they are deployed", "Description: 'You and I will cease one day, but our country is everlasting.'", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000000F0.title: "Obtain Guard Cap"
	quest.C300000000000103.title: "Viviparous Lily"
	quest.C300000000000103.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000103.quest_desc: ["Original effect: When a battle begins, reduces the DP Cost of all Operators by 3, then scrambles their DP Cost", "Description: An organism that defies common sense. A plant-like ability to reproduce, an animal-like desire to.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000103.title: "Obtain Viviparous Lily"
	quest.C300000000000105.title: "Black Tulip"
	quest.C300000000000105.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000105.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Friendly Operators gradually gain ATK when not using a skill, up to a maximum of +60% after 60 seconds; this bonus will be reset when a skill ends", "Description: The Silence crushed the Iberians, so she wishes to speak up. If her words are not sharp enough, then her sword will speak for her.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000105.title: "Obtain Black Tulip"
	quest.C300000000000109.title: "Fincatcher S Shawl"
	quest.C300000000000109.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000109.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Ranged Operators gain Camouflage", "Description: A shawl often worn by Iberian seamen when they went to hunt giant fins in the shallows, the unique texture and color making them blend in with the reef. The Rhodes Island Engineering Department designed a combat uniform with an optical camouflage effect based on this prototype, which is currently in the testing stage.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000109.title: "Obtain Fincatcher S Shawl"
	quest.C30000000000010E.title: "Old George Nutritional Paste"
	quest.C30000000000010E.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C30000000000010E.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Operators have increased ATK proportional to how high their HP is, up to a maximum of +30% ATK at 100% HP", "Description: This poor-tasting fortified nutritional supplement was originally a 'dietary supplement' periodically provided to Columbian Pioneers, but after extensive marketing, it suddenly became a 'beauty product' beloved by nobles.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000010E.title: "Obtain Old George Nutritional Paste"
	quest.C300000000000113.title: "Timeworn Poetry Strips"
	quest.C300000000000113.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000113.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Summons will no longer use Deployment slots", "Description: 'Drunk far beyond all mounts that list the realm, all beings take on souls as they demand.'", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000113.title: "Obtain Timeworn Poetry Strips"
	quest.C30000000000011B.title: "Rusted Blade No Man S Land"
	quest.C30000000000011B.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C30000000000011B.quest_desc: ["Original effect: The Redeployment Time of Specialist Operators is reduced by -35%", "Description: Sound is eliminated the moment the shadows pass by, and whoever hears them is next.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000011B.title: "Obtain Rusted Blade No Man S Land"
	quest.C300000000000120.title: "Game Room Admin Access Card"
	quest.C300000000000120.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000120.quest_desc: ["Original effect: 【实在的】立即进阶一个干员（不消耗希望）\n【巧思的】立即获得源石锭+1，并进阶一个干员（不消耗希望）\n【幻想的】立即获得源石锭+2，并进阶一个干员（不消耗希望）\n【架空的】立即获得源石锭+3，并进阶一个干员（不消耗希望）", "Description: With this, you have become master over Rhodes Island's entertainment privileges. Please exercise caution when processing the various strange applications from the Operators... and remember to lock the door every day.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000120.title: "Obtain Game Room Admin Access Card"
	quest.C30000000000012F.title: "Dario S Lantern"
	quest.C30000000000012F.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C30000000000012F.quest_desc: ["Original effect: When obtained, suppresses a designated Operator's Rejection", "Description: A lantern once wielded by Inquisitor Dario. Even after his death, the flames of his conviction still burn brightly upon this land.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000012F.title: "Obtain Dario S Lantern"
	quest.C300000000000131.title: "Tulip S Secret Formula"
	quest.C300000000000131.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000131.quest_desc: ["Original effect: When obtained, suppresses a designated Operator's Rejection", "Description: An emergency topical ointment produced through empirical analysis and numerous clinical trials, capable of effectively inhibiting the adverse side-effects Seaborn cells cause within the human body.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000131.title: "Obtain Tulip S Secret Formula"
	quest.C30000000000013D.title: "Failed Specimen"
	quest.C30000000000013D.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C30000000000013D.quest_desc: ["Original effect: When obtained, immediately afflicts a random Operator with a Rejection", "Description: An incomplete shelled specimen. Debris falls from small crevices, sticks together, accumulates, and merges with the dead plants inside, until the original husk is completely swallowed up.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000013D.title: "Obtain Failed Specimen"
	quest.C300000000000142.title: "Breath Of The Tide"
	quest.C300000000000142.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000142.quest_desc: ["Original effect: +1 Deployment Limit; when obtained, [Tide-Hunt Knight] will appear on the battlefield until defeated", "Description: He appeared near you because he smelled the scent of the tides. You mean nothing to him.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000142.title: "Obtain Breath Of The Tide"
	quest.C30000000000014C.title: "Bedrock"
	quest.C30000000000014C.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C30000000000014C.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All Operators have +5 DP Cost, but gain +15% ATK, DEF, and HP", "Description: A weapon said to have been made specifically for an Abyssal Hunter. His master once fought alongside Skadi, smashing the tentacles of a benthic behemoth. But when he cast aside his weapon to block a bony projectile for Skadi, he vanished into the midst of the Sea Terrors' swarm.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000014C.title: "Obtain Bedrock"
	quest.C30000000000014D.title: "Wavebreaker"
	quest.C30000000000014D.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C30000000000014D.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All Operators have -25% HP, but have -50% Redeployment Time", "Description: A weapon said to have been made specifically for an Abyssal Hunter. Her master once was one of Gladiia's team members, responsible for culling countless Sea Terrors. But in order to allow the other teams to approach the benthic behemoth, she voluntarily stayed behind after being seriously wounded, and nobody ever saw her again.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000014D.title: "Obtain Wavebreaker"
	quest.C300000000000152.title: "Endless Life"
	quest.C300000000000152.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000152.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Afflicts a random Operator with a Rejection at the start of each new floor", "Description: Sac-like tissues found in Sea Terrors, used to store eggs prior to laying them. They detach from the host after death, maintaining activity for a period of time. Be careful not to break them!", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000152.title: "Obtain Endless Life"
	quest.C300000000000155.title: "Hr Bronze Seal"
	quest.C300000000000155.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000155.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Recruit a random 5-star Operator that is automatically Promoted", "Description: Emblem assigned to specific Operators when ■■■ receives an emergency deployment command. Your receipt of it signifies that ■■■ has completed the assignment.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000155.title: "Obtain Hr Bronze Seal"
	quest.C300000000000156.title: "Doctor Silver Seal"
	quest.C300000000000156.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000156.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Recruit a random 6-star Operator that is automatically Promoted", "Description: Emblem that you instructed to be sent out at the right time before you left. Your selected Operator has joined the field mission at the camp, while handing it back to you the way you left it.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000156.title: "Obtain Doctor Silver Seal"
	quest.C300000000000169.title: "Leisure Time"
	quest.C300000000000169.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000169.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Squad Size Limit +1, Anti-Interference Index +1", "Description: The children are experts at picking up all sorts of things to build their own play-kingdom. The wetland dwellers are accustomed to the outsiders always abruptly abandoning their vehicles halfway to their destination.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000169.title: "Obtain Leisure Time"
	quest.C30000000000016C.title: "Celestial Dust"
	quest.C30000000000016C.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C30000000000016C.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Ranged Operators Levitate all enemies within attack range for 2 seconds when a skill is manually activated", "Description: She gently blows away the countless records of sunrises, moonsets, and the changing of the stars. Her life is blown away that easily.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000016C.title: "Obtain Celestial Dust"
	quest.C300000000000170.title: "Dead Tree S Echo"
	quest.C300000000000170.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000170.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All Operators recover 50 HP every second, but have Max HP -25%", "Description: Drum to call their ancestors' souls, drum to communicate with the vegetation, drum to exorcise evil spirits. Shaman after shaman have received this beastbone hammer, some leaving a longer echo than the others.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000170.title: "Obtain Dead Tree S Echo"
