	quest.C300000000000173.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Designates one deployable tile at the beginning of battle; allied units deployed on that tile or its surrounding 8 tiles will gain Camouflage", "Description: Those within this ring receive the favor of the thorns and leaves.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
