	quest.C300000000000174.title: "Living Woodplate"
	quest.C300000000000174.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000174.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All allied melee units gain a Barrier equal to 50% of their Max HP on deployment", "Description: The shamans know how trees will cling to survival, so they invite the trees to become armor for a warrior possessing a similar will.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000174.title: "Obtain Living Woodplate"
	quest.C300000000000182.title: "Hand Of Adaptability"
	quest.C300000000000182.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000182.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Charger, Pioneer, and Tactician Operators have -10 DP Cost, and after defeating an enemy grant -1 DP Cost to all undeployed Operators on their next deployment", "Description: What we lack now is not battlefield intelligence, but a captain who is able to finish reading said intelligence in time.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000182.title: "Obtain Hand Of Adaptability"
	quest.C300000000000187.title: "Heavy Music Anthology"
	quest.C300000000000187.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000187.quest_desc: ["Original effect: -2 Collapse value, Hope +2", "Description: Every winter, Columbian rescue crews stationed in southern Sami have several missions to rescue bands who get lost in the snowy woods while filming music videos.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000187.title: "Obtain Heavy Music Anthology"
	quest.C300000000000190.title: "Rainbow Jar"
	quest.C300000000000190.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000190.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Whenever an enemy enters the Objective Point, immediately selects a random Operator waiting to be re-deployable, and reduces their Redeployment Time by half", "Description: It is usually placed by the Sami people wherever the rainbow falls. They are meticulously maintained in order to withstand the untraceable catastrophes, both natural and man-made.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000190.title: "Obtain Rainbow Jar"
	quest.C300000000000192.title: "Cannot S Mark"
	quest.C300000000000192.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000192.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Gain 1 Hope whenever you buy an item at the Rogue Trader or make an exchange at Lost and Found", "Description: Some people are willing to do Cannot a favor, and some are worthy for Cannot to do a 'favor.'", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000192.title: "Obtain Cannot S Mark"
	quest.C30000000000019B.title: "Two Step Firecracker And Data Collector"
	quest.C30000000000019B.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C30000000000019B.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Bring 5 Two-step Firecracker and Data-collectors to each battle", "Description: One-time data collection device that emits a loud popping sound when activated. A Yanese operator has added the following note to the manual: 'It only pops once.'", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000019B.title: "Obtain Two Step Firecracker And Data Collector"
	quest.C3000000000001A6.title: "Fragment Of Space"
	quest.C3000000000001A6.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C3000000000001A6.quest_desc: ["Original effect: -4 Squad Size Limit", "Description: The space here has been indiscriminately torn to shreds, leaving only a tiny piece.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000001A6.title: "Obtain Fragment Of Space"
	quest.C3000000000001AA.title: "Blunt Claws Fuel"
	quest.C3000000000001AA.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C3000000000001AA.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every Vanguard Operator on the field, gain 1 DP every 3 seconds (stacks up to 8 times)", "Description: The flames turn more intense with each additional firewood added to the pile.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000001AA.title: "Obtain Blunt Claws Fuel"
	quest.C3000000000001B0.title: "Healer S Path Wellspring"
	quest.C3000000000001B0.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C3000000000001B0.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every Medic Operator on the field, all allies gain Redeployment Time -5% (stacks up to 8 times)", "Description: They are clear springs formed from flowing water, and they heal all that live.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000001B0.title: "Obtain Healer S Path Wellspring"
	quest.C3000000000001B1.title: "Rusted Blade Disturbance"
	quest.C3000000000001B1.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C3000000000001B1.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every Specialist Operator on the field, all enemies have -5% Movement Speed (stacks up to 8 times)", "Description: Delay the enemy bit by bit, just like slicing a sausage, and by the time they realize it there will be nothing they can do.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000001B1.title: "Obtain Rusted Blade Disturbance"
	quest.C3000000000001B2.title: "Palmtop Pavilion"
	quest.C3000000000001B2.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C3000000000001B2.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All Operators gain +1 Block, and an additional +1 Block after being deployed for more than 60 seconds", "Description: The Tumu Tianshi's masterpiece. Fits in one hand, but throw it to the ground and it turns into the ground floor of the Chamber of Heaven's Designs' outer pavilion. Once a secret of the Tianshi Bureaus, now mass-produced and widely used in garrisons and expeditions on the icefield.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000001B2.title: "Obtain Palmtop Pavilion"
	quest.C3000000000001BB.title: "Hibernating Kin"
	quest.C3000000000001BB.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C3000000000001BB.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Hope +5, obtain an extra Collectible when this Collectible is exchanged in Lost and Found", "Description: Lost in the silver mountain range, the Sarkaz hibernated for self-preservation. It slept so long it nearly lost itself, until its fated kin awoke it. Now, it will follow his path.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000001BB.title: "Obtain Hibernating Kin"
	quest.C3000000000001C3.title: "Half Eaten Candy"
	quest.C3000000000001C3.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C3000000000001C3.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Squad Size Limit +1, Toil Limit +2", "Description: 'With every piece of candy I eat, I feel like I'm losing a part of my body. But I still want to eat more, and more... until that black shadow showed up and ripped away the monster inside me. But that hollow in my mind will never be filled.'", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000001C3.title: "Obtain Half Eaten Candy"
	quest.C3000000000001C7.title: "Blunt Claws Predation"
	quest.C3000000000001C7.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C3000000000001C7.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every Vanguard Operator on the field, gain 1 DP every 3 seconds (Stacks up to 8 times)", "Description: The pack rumbles with hunger, waiting for a feast.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000001C7.title: "Obtain Blunt Claws Predation"
	quest.C3000000000001CA.title: "Rusted Blade Protraction"
	quest.C3000000000001CA.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C3000000000001CA.quest_desc: ["Original effect: For every Specialist Operator on the field, all enemies have -5% Movement Speed (Stacks up to 8 times)", "Description: If the host does not want guests, they'll never reach the door.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000001CA.title: "Obtain Rusted Blade Protraction"
	quest.C3000000000001D8.title: "Primordial Vestige"
	quest.C3000000000001D8.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C3000000000001D8.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All Operators DP Cost -6 if you did not use an Inspirer as the battle started", "Description: The most significant change in these animals is the mutation they undergo after contracting Oripathy. Otherwise, their records have remained unchanged for countless years.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000001D8.title: "Obtain Primordial Vestige"
	quest.C3000000000001F0.title: "Fabrication Mystery"
	quest.C3000000000001F0.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C3000000000001F0.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Starting DP +50, but natural DP regeneration rate is reduced by 50%; only active in Bizarre Fragments", "Description: The 'Great Deceiver' once visited this Place of Possibility. She enriched the scenery with vivid tales, invited Sarkaz to hear ancient stories, and left puzzles revealing historical insights if solved. Yet, people insisted the Djall Arch-liar spoke only lies, leaving the Sarkaz convinced that what they heard was mere fabrications.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C4000000000001F0.title: "Obtain Fabrication Mystery"
	quest.C300000000000207.title: "Qui Sartustaj S Promise"
	quest.C300000000000207.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000207.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All 5-star and above Operators cost +1 Hope to recruit and promote", "Description: With every changing generation, he promised his people and his carriers he would change the status quo for the Sarkaz. Within the layers of amassed hope and trust, he placed the crown on the ring-shaped structure, and knocked on the gates to the starry sky.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000207.title: "Obtain Qui Sartustaj S Promise"
	quest.C30000000000020A.title: "Shard Of The Untold Kings"
	quest.C30000000000020A.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C30000000000020A.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Loadbearing Operators have -30% ATK", "Description: A guardian of the Temple of Knowledge uses their phylactery to unveil the mysteries of life, a crazy Sarkaz mercenary saddles a revenant to sow chaos, a vexing Beast Aristocrat establishes a commercial empire with the furnace, an ancient Feline wears the crown and subdues her own creator... Many stories remain folded within thoughts, waiting to be told.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000020A.title: "Obtain Shard Of The Untold Kings"
	quest.C300000000000216.title: "Cursed Counterbeast"
	quest.C300000000000216.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000216.quest_desc: ["Original effect: All Operators gain +5 ASPD; consumes 1 Inspirer after each battle to grant an additional 5 ASPD (stacks up to 10 times)", "Description: These bizarre beasts, born of falsehood, are drawn to fleeting flashes of odd thoughts. They devour wantonly, and when time shatters and paradoxes surge, they give birth to new cubs.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000216.title: "Obtain Cursed Counterbeast"
	quest.C300000000000217.title: "Rhoder S Gate"
	quest.C300000000000217.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000217.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Immediately recruit multiple Reserve Operators; at the end of each combat, the last deployed Operator will be sent to a Scout node", "Description: This remodeled Portal binds two stories together, with the other end being Rhozdel—a safe haven for both Sarkaz and Infected.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000217.title: "Obtain Rhoder S Gate"
	quest.C30000000000021B.title: "Baby Djall"
	quest.C30000000000021B.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C30000000000021B.quest_desc: ["Original effect: +3 Hope, obtain an extra +8 Hope when this Collectible is exchanged in Lost and Found", "Description: 'Oh, my little cutie-pie! Enough tickling my head, alright?'", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000021B.title: "Obtain Baby Djall"
	quest.C30000000000021E.title: "Osmanthus Goblet"
	quest.C30000000000021E.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C30000000000021E.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Hope +4, immediately gain 5 Originium Ingots, obtain an extra Collectible when this Collectible is exchanged in Lost and Found", "Description: This priceless porcelain cup bears the words 'May the beholder be victorious'. Rumors say a complete set of twelve exist, and a certain collector is missing this last one.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000021E.title: "Obtain Osmanthus Goblet"
	quest.C30000000000022C.title: "Yanese Dictionary"
	quest.C30000000000022C.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C30000000000022C.quest_desc: ["Original effect: When Operators use an ammo-type skill and consume 70% of ammo for the first time, replenishes 30% of max ammo count", "Description: Yan's first ever common dictionary, compiled by a civilian writer after over a decade of work. The editor often sighed over how thin the volumes were despite the amount of text, and dedicated a tomb to rare characters that could not be included or recorded.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000022C.title: "Obtain Yanese Dictionary"
	quest.C30000000000022D.title: "Collection Of Elegance"
	quest.C30000000000022D.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C30000000000022D.quest_desc: ["Original effect: When Operators use an ammo-type skill and consume 70% of ammo for the first time, replenishes 50% of max ammo count", "Description: Yan's first poetry collection containing the most popular poems of the year it was published. Its immense popularity sparked a surge within the masses to copy the poems or write new ones, leading to a shortage of paper and ink.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000022D.title: "Obtain Collection Of Elegance"
	quest.C300000000000230.title: "Yi Lock"
	quest.C300000000000230.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000230.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Two random deployable Vagary Tiles will grant 8 DP when Operators are deployed on them (Can be upgraded in Lost and Found)", "Description: One of Yi's inventions, used by Ji to rake in a fortune. Both an ornament and education toy, and if you can comprehend its secrets, perhaps you will understand 'Sui' much better.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000230.title: "Obtain Yi Lock"
	quest.C300000000000231.title: "Complex Yi Lock"
	quest.C300000000000231.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000231.quest_desc: ["Original effect: Five random deployable Vagary Tiles will grant 10 DP when Operators are deployed on them", "Description: A Yi lock, modified by its creator, now much more complicated. How the pieces lock in place no longer make much sense. However, grasp its secrets, and perhaps you will understand 'Sui' much, much better.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000231.title: "Obtain Complex Yi Lock"
	quest.C300000000000234.title: "Intro To Weiqi Openings"
	quest.C300000000000234.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000234.quest_desc: ["Original effect: 3 Broken Fog Machines will randomly spawn on the map on Vagary Tiles", "Description: Why make that move within this space? The sound on the board ceases, a content game. The match is over... and times have changed.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C400000000000234.title: "Obtain Intro To Weiqi Openings"
	quest.C30000000000023C.title: "Chamber Of Geists Ledger"
	quest.C30000000000023C.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C30000000000023C.quest_desc: ["Original effect: The DP Cost of Tactical Props, Summons, and Devices is reduced by 10", "Description: Liu'er excitedly invites you to 'try' the Chamber of Geists' newest invention. You decline, citing your tight purse strings, but then you spot her casually scribbling on a ledger. Now, your excuse no longer stands.", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
	task.C40000000000023C.title: "Obtain Chamber Of Geists Ledger"
	quest.C300000000000242.title: "Rhodes Island Emergency Rescue Vehicle"
	quest.C300000000000242.quest_subtitle: "Squad and Recruitment"
	quest.C300000000000242.quest_desc: ["Original effect: +2 Hope; Receive aid from a random Rhodes Island Elite Operator when fighting in Sui's Remnant Consciousness", "Description: No matter where your orders may send them—Elite Operators are sure to succeed!", "Equip in any accessory slot; see the item tooltip and Abilities panel for the Minecraft effect."]
